        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Whit Stillman, Greta Gerwig, Adam Brody, Analeigh Tipton, Taylor Nichols\n- Works: Damsels in Distress, Metropolitan, Barcelona, The Last Days of Disco\n- Topics: American film, acting, filmmaking\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Nichols was born as Cecil Taylor Nichols on March 3, 1959, in Louisville, Kentucky.\n- Greta Gerwig was born as Greta Celeste Gerwig on August 4, 1983.\n- Greta Gerwig is an American actress and filmmaker.\n- Damsels in Distress, originally titled Violet Wister's Damsels in Distress and Whit Stillman's Damsels in Distress, is an American comedy film.\n- Whit Stillman wrote and directed Damsels in Distress.\n- Greta Gerwig, Adam Brody, and Analeigh Tipton starred in Damsels in Distress.\n- Taylor Nichols is an American actor.\n- Taylor Nichols is best known for roles in Whit Stillman's films Metropolitan, Barcelona, The Last Days of Disco, and Damsels in Distress.",
